3. R/sysdata.rda and the two crosswalks: the Unicode emoji catalogue
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The emoji catalogue tidyEmoji detects and joins against (glyphs, their
qualification status, Unicode emoji version, CLDR short name, group and
subgroup), and the glyph and category columns of data/emoji_unicode_crosswalk.rda
and data/category_unicode_crosswalk.rda, are derived from the Unicode emoji
test data file:

Source:    emoji-test.txt, Unicode Emoji 18.0 (file dated 2026-04-30),
           https://www.unicode.org/Public/emoji/latest/emoji-test.txt
Rebuilt:   data-raw/crosswalks.R in the package's source repository
Licence:   Unicode License V3, reproduced below.
           https://www.unicode.org/license.txt

The shortcode and keyword vocabulary is read at run time from the `emoji` R
package (a declared Import), not bundled; see that package for its terms.

